lin grandmother lantern seller vendor~
Grandmother Lin the lantern seller~
Grandmother Lin sits beneath a pole hung with red paper lanterns.
~
A tiny, bright-eyed old woman wrapped in red silk embroidered with golden
clouds.  A bamboo pole over her shoulder is strung with paper lanterns, and
a lacquered box at her feet holds sweets and rockets for the new year.  She
bows to everyone who passes, as though each of them were her elder.
~
