rosalind flower seller vendor~
Rosalind the flower seller~
Rosalind arranges red roses in a cart trimmed with paper hearts.
~
A young woman with rose petals caught in her dark curls and a pink ribbon
around her wrist.  Her little cart overflows with red roses, boxes of
chocolates and lockets on silver chains, and she hums a love song as she
works.  She seems certain that everybody is in love with somebody.
~
