#29802
finnegan tinker vendor~
Finnegan the tinker~
Finnegan the tinker sits on an overturned keg, whistling a jig.
~
A red-bearded little man in a green coat with brass buttons and a hat
with a buckle on it.  He keeps a basket of clovers on one knee and a pint
on the other, and swears that every clover in the basket is lucky -- the
four-leafed ones especially, which he will not sell at any price.
~
