Hopscotch the egg warden peers about for eggs nobody has found yet.
~
A halfling in a waistcoat painted with flowers, wearing a pair of long
cloth rabbit ears that flop when he nods.  He has hidden painted eggs all
over Dresden and is very pleased with himself about it.  Somewhere in each
egg, he says, is a little something for whoever finds it.
~
