abigail matron orphanage vendor~
Matron Abigail of the orphanage~
Matron Abigail keeps one eye on her stall and one on a crowd of children.
~
A stout, kindly woman in a starched apron, surrounded by a small storm
of orphans who keep stealing her lollipops.  She sells toys for the
children's week fair and gives every copper of it to the orphanage, and
she will tell you so whether you ask or not.
~
