#29805
ashby keeper flame vendor~
Keeper Ashby of the summer flame~
Keeper Ashby tends the midsummer fire, sparks dancing about his hands.
~
A lean man in a robe of orange and gold, his eyebrows long since singed
away.  He has kept the midsummer fire burning since before most of
Dresden was born, and he sells flower crowns and rockets to anyone who
will promise to honour the flame -- or at least not to put it out.
~
human~
