#29806
saltbeard captain pirate vendor~
Captain Saltbeard~
Captain Saltbeard leans on a barrel of grog, a parrot muttering on his shoulder.
~
A weathered old sea dog with one good eye, one peg leg and a beard white
with salt.  His parrot repeats every price he names, a little higher.
He has come ashore for one day a year to sell hats, grog and tall tales,
and to see that the whole of Dresden talks like a proper pirate.
~
