prudence goodwife cook vendor~
Goodwife Prudence the cook~
Goodwife Prudence lays yet another dish on the harvest table.
~
A plump, flour-dusted woman with her sleeves rolled up and a ladle in
each hand.  She has been cooking for the Pilgrim's Bounty feast for a
week and will not rest until everyone in Dresden has eaten twice.  The
smell of roast turkey and pumpkin pie follows her everywhere.
~
