#29810
lanterns red paper decorations~
strings of red paper lanterns~
Strings of red paper lanterns sway overhead, glowing for the Lunar Festival.~
paper~
13 A 0
0 0 0 0 0
0 100 0 P
E
lanterns red paper decorations~
Hundreds of red paper lanterns hang on strings from tree to tree across
the square, each with a golden tassel and a wish written on it in neat
black brush strokes.  When the wind moves them they glow like a field of
little suns.  Rockets and red envelopes are said to bring luck this time
of year; the lantern seller has the one, and the creatures of the world
seem to carry the other.
~

#29811
garland paper hearts decorations~
a garland of paper hearts~
A garland of paper hearts is strung across the square for Love is in the Air.~
paper~
13 A 0
0 0 0 0 0
0 100 0 P
E
garland paper hearts decorations~
Pink and red paper hearts, hundreds of them, strung on ribbons from the
oak's lowest branches to every lamp post in the square.  Some carry names.
Some carry two names.  A red rose given to someone, the flower seller
says, blesses the one who gives it and the one who receives it alike.
~

