E
rainbow painted pot gold decorations~
A great arch of canvas painted in every colour, propped on two poles, and
at its foot a wooden pot painted gold.  The pot is empty -- somebody has
checked.  The tinker swears the real gold turns up for those who eat a
four-leafed clover, and that the creatures of the world have been finding
four-leafed clovers all week.
~

