basket painted eggs decorations~
A wicker basket taller than a man, heaped with eggs painted in stripes,
spots and swirls of every colour.  None of them are for taking: the egg
warden has hidden plenty of others all over Dresden for that, and says
that each one opens to show a little something inside.
~

