bonfire midsummer fire flame decorations~
A pyramid of logs as tall as a house, roaring with flame and throwing
sparks up past the leaves of the Oak Tree.  Flower crowns have been tossed
into it for luck.  Now and then someone drops a festival rocket on the
ground nearby, and the whole sky lights up.
~

