ofrenda altar marigolds candles decorations~
A tiered altar of painted wood, covered in orange marigolds, candles,
sugar skulls and small portraits of the dead.  The candles never seem to
burn down.  It is a day for remembering, the candle-keeper says, not for
mourning, and the sugar skulls show you a little of what the dead see.
~

