harvest table feast decorations~
Trestle tables pushed end to end and buried under platters: roast turkey,
sweet potatoes, cranberries, cornbread and more pumpkin pie than any town
could eat.  Goodwife Prudence keeps adding to it.  A good meal, she says,
leaves you stronger for the road.
~

